Article 7 (Qualifications of Tenants of Bogeumjari Housing) The qualifications of tenants of Bogeumjari Housing under Article 36 (3) of the Decree shall be determined in the following order of priority: <Amended on April 21, 2009>
1. First priority: Tenants of houses demolished as a result of an urban renewal promotion project;
2. Second priority: Owners of houses demolished as a result of an urban renewal promotion project;
3. Third priority: Persons who do not fall under first or second priority and who are designated pursuant to Article 32 of the Rules on Housing Supply.
